    "name": "choice",
    "text": "<p>Выберите верные утверждения.</p>\n\n<p>Программа 1.</p>\n\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n#include &lt;string&gt;\n\nconst char* printer() {\n    std::string s1 = \"aboba\";\n\n    std::cout &lt;&lt; s1 &lt;&lt; '\\n';\n\n    return s1.c_str();\n}\n\nint main() {\n    const char* s1 = printer();\n    std::cout &lt;&lt; s1 &lt;&lt; '\\n';\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>Программа 2.</p>\n\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n#include &lt;string&gt;\n\nvoid stringIntPrinter(const std::string&amp; s) {\n    for (int i = 0; i &lt; s.length() - 1; i++) {\n        std::cout &lt;&lt; static_cast&lt;int&gt;(s[i]) &lt;&lt; ' ';\n    }\n    std::cout &lt;&lt; '\\n';\n}\n\nint main() {\n    std::string s0, s1 = \"Hello\";\n    stringIntPrinter(s1);\n    stringIntPrinter(s0);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>Программа 3.</p>\n\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n#include &lt;string&gt;\n\nint main() {\n    std::string s0 = \"a\", s1 = \"boba\";\n    s0 = s0 + s1;\n    std::cout &lt;&lt; s0;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n</code></pre>",
